'''Deathly rangers''' are monsters found in the [[Chambers of Xeric]], in the [[tightrope room]]. In solo and small groups, players will find two deathly rangers alongside two [[deathly mage]]s.

While initially unaggressive, they will attack any player that attempts to cross the tightrope. Their attacks can be partially reduced with [[Protect from Missiles]] active, though they can still hit reasonably high.

Any rangers in the room automatically die upon using the [[Keystone crystal|keystone]] on the barrier.

